<!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:acf/image-card-grid {"name":"acf/image-card-grid","data":{"headline":"How Athena works","_headline":"field_image_card_grid_block_headline","subheadline":"","_subheadline":"field_image_card_grid_block_subheadline","columns":3,"_columns":"field_image_card_grid_block_columns","card_title_size":"large","_card_title_size":"field_image_card_grid_block_card_title_size","cards":3,"_cards":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards","cards_0_image":308,"_cards_0_image":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_image","cards_0_eyebrow":"","_cards_0_eyebrow":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_eyebrow","cards_0_title":"Pricing model and what's included","_cards_0_title":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_title","cards_0_text":"Athena charges $3,000 per month under a 12-month contract. This includes a matched Executive Assistant, along with payroll, taxes, and compliance handled by Athena on your behalf.","_cards_0_text":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_text","cards_1_image":303,"_cards_1_image":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_image","cards_1_eyebrow":"","_cards_1_eyebrow":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_eyebrow","cards_1_title":"How matching and onboarding work","_cards_1_title":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_title","cards_1_text":"Once you sign on, Athena matches you with an Executive Assistant, typically within 2–3 weeks. New EAs complete a structured training program.","_cards_1_text":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_text","cards_2_image":304,"_cards_2_image":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_image","cards_2_eyebrow":"","_cards_2_eyebrow":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_eyebrow","cards_2_title":"The buyer Athena is built\u003cbr\u003efor","_cards_2_title":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_title","cards_2_text":"Athena is designed for founders and executives who want a single, dedicated Executive Assistant to support a wide range of tasks from scheduling to inbox management to general operations.","_cards_2_text":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_text"},"align":"full","mode":"preview","metadata":{"name":"how-competitor-works"}} /--><!-- wp:acf/media-copy {"name":"acf/media-copy","data":{"headline":"Roles and Industries\u003cbr\u003eAthena Supports","_headline":"field_media_copy_block_headline","body":"\u003cp\u003eAthena offers a single role — Executive Assistant — trained as a generalist to support founders and executives across a wide range of industries. Rather than matching clients with someone experienced in their specific field, Athena prepares every EA the same way, so they can adapt to different business needs as they come up. This means you won’t find role-specific specialists through Athena, like a bookkeeper for a finance firm or a credentialed assistant for a healthcare practice — every client works with the same type of generalist support, regardless of industry.\u003c/p\u003e","_body":"field_media_copy_block_body","image":"","_image":"field_media_copy_block_image","cta_text":"","_cta_text":"field_media_copy_block_cta_text","cta_url":"#booking-footer","_cta_url":"field_media_copy_block_cta_url","tone":"dark","_tone":"field_media_copy_block_tone","heading_beside_body":1,"_heading_beside_body":"field_media_copy_block_heading_beside_body"},"align":"full","mode":"preview","metadata":{"name":"competitor-roles"}} /--><!-- wp:acf/talent-carousel {"name":"acf/talent-carousel","data":{"headline":"Finding the right talent to help you scale","_headline":"field_talent_carousel_block_headline","body":"\u003cp\u003eFinding the right talent means scaling smarter, not more expensively. Virtual assistants deliver top-tier support for a fraction of in-house costs. You save on salaries, benefits, and overhead while freeing your core team. That lets you reinvest cash into growth and focus on what truly moves the needle.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eResult:\u003c/strong\u003e You grow faster, spend less, and scale leaner with every VA you hire.\u003c/p\u003e","_body":"field_talent_carousel_block_body","cta_text":"BOOK A CONSULTATION","_cta_text":"field_talent_carousel_block_cta_text","cta_url":"#booking-footer","_cta_url":"field_talent_carousel_block_cta_url","profiles":3,"_profiles":"field_talent_carousel_block_profiles","profiles_0_image":279,"_profiles_0_image":"field_talent_carousel_block_profiles_image","profiles_0_name":"María Fernanda","_profiles_0_name":"field_talent_carousel_block_profiles_name","profiles_0_role":"Administrative Assistant","_profiles_0_role":"field_talent_carousel_block_profiles_role","profiles_0_rate":"$8 Per Hour","_profiles_0_rate":"field_talent_carousel_block_profiles_rate","profiles_1_image":280,"_profiles_1_image":"field_talent_carousel_block_profiles_image","profiles_1_name":"Luciana Lopez","_profiles_1_name":"field_talent_carousel_block_profiles_name","profiles_1_role":"Sales Representative","_profiles_1_role":"field_talent_carousel_block_profiles_role","profiles_1_rate":"$10 Per Hour","_profiles_1_rate":"field_talent_carousel_block_profiles_rate","profiles_2_image":214,"_profiles_2_image":"field_talent_carousel_block_profiles_image","profiles_2_name":"Catalina García","_profiles_2_name":"field_talent_carousel_block_profiles_name","profiles_2_role":"Social Media Manager","_profiles_2_role":"field_talent_carousel_block_profiles_role","profiles_2_rate":"$12 Per Hour","_profiles_2_rate":"field_talent_carousel_block_profiles_rate"},"align":"full","mode":"preview","metadata":{"name":"talent-carousel"}} /--><!-- wp:acf/media-copy {"name":"acf/media-copy","align":"full","mode":"preview","data":{"headline":"Talent pool, time zones, and language standards","_headline":"field_media_copy_block_headline","body":"\u003cp\u003eRemote Leverage offers professionals in highly compatible time zones who cover a broad spectrum of roles – from executive assistants to operations specialists. This means faster turnaround, smoother collaboration, and no costly delays waiting for responses.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eResult:\u003c/strong\u003e You get the right talent, in the right time zone, for the right role – every time.\u003c/p\u003e","_body":"field_media_copy_block_body","image":309,"_image":"field_media_copy_block_image","image_position":"left","_image_position":"field_media_copy_block_image_position","cta_text":"BOOK A CONSULTATION","_cta_text":"field_media_copy_block_cta_text","cta_url":"#booking-footer","_cta_url":"field_media_copy_block_cta_url"},"metadata":{"name":"talent-pool"}} /--><!-- wp:acf/guarantee-card {"name":"acf/guarantee-card","data":{"headline":"12-Month Replacement Guarantee","_headline":"field_guarantee_card_headline","cta_text":"Book a consultation","_cta_text":"field_guarantee_card_cta_text","cta_url":"#booking-footer","_cta_url":"field_guarantee_card_cta_url","body":"\u003cp\u003e12-Month free replacement guarantee on any Virtual Assistant you hire through us to ensure you have a perfect fit. You’ll also have a dedicated manager to help you set up training, performance tracking, and any other support you need.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNo contracts or commitments.\u003cbr /\u003eWe get paid a flat hiring fee if you choose to hire a Virtual Assistant after interviewing our applicants.\u003c/p\u003e","_body":"field_guarantee_card_body"},"align":"","mode":"preview","metadata":{"name":"guarantee"}} /--><!-- wp:acf/image-card-grid {"name":"acf/image-card-grid","data":{"headline":"How payroll and\u003cbr\u003ecompliance actually work","_headline":"field_image_card_grid_block_headline","subheadline":"","_subheadline":"field_image_card_grid_block_subheadline","columns":3,"_columns":"field_image_card_grid_block_columns","card_title_size":"large","_card_title_size":"field_image_card_grid_block_card_title_size","cta_text":"","_cta_text":"field_image_card_grid_block_cta_text","cta_url":"#booking-footer","_cta_url":"field_image_card_grid_block_cta_url","cards":3,"_cards":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards","cards_0_image":305,"_cards_0_image":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_image","cards_0_eyebrow":"","_cards_0_eyebrow":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_eyebrow","cards_0_title":"No payment if we don't find the right talent","_cards_0_title":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_title","cards_0_text":"You only pay when we deliver. If we don't find the right fit for your role, you owe nothing, no upfront risk, no wasted budget on a placement that doesn't work out.","_cards_0_text":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_text","cards_1_image":306,"_cards_1_image":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_image","cards_1_eyebrow":"","_cards_1_eyebrow":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_eyebrow","cards_1_title":"Payments, compliance, onboarding support","_cards_1_title":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_title","cards_1_text":"Your new hire slots right into your dashboard. Manage payroll cycles, compliance reporting, and multi-currency payments in one platform.","_cards_1_text":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_text","cards_2_image":307,"_cards_2_image":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_image","cards_2_eyebrow":"","_cards_2_eyebrow":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_eyebrow","cards_2_title":"No ongoing\u003cbr\u003emiddleman fees","_cards_2_title":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_title","cards_2_text":"Hire direct. No contracts, no hidden fees. Remote Leverage's 12-month replacement guarantee ensures you get the perfect hire.","_cards_2_text":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_text"},"align":"full","mode":"preview","metadata":{"name":"payroll"}} /--><!-- wp:acf/cost-comparison {"name":"acf/cost-comparison","data":{"eyebrow":"","_eyebrow":"field_cost_comparison_block_eyebrow","headline":"The Full Picture","_headline":"field_cost_comparison_block_headline","description":"","_description":"field_cost_comparison_block_description","table_1_title":"Athena","_table_1_title":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_1_title","table_1_theme":"competitor","_table_1_theme":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_1_theme","table_2_title":"Remote Leverage","_table_2_title":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_2_title","table_2_theme":"leverage","_table_2_theme":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_2_theme","cta_text":"","_cta_text":"field_cost_comparison_block_cta_text","cta_url":"#booking-footer","_cta_url":"field_cost_comparison_block_cta_url","table_1_rows":6,"_table_1_rows":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_1_rows","table_2_rows":6,"_table_2_rows":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_2_rows","table_1_rows_0_label":"Hiring model","_table_1_rows_0_label":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_1_rows_label","table_1_rows_0_value":"Managed service","_table_1_rows_0_value":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_1_rows_value","table_2_rows_0_label":"Hiring model","_table_2_rows_0_label":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_2_rows_label","table_2_rows_0_value":"Recruiting (direct hire)","_table_2_rows_0_value":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_2_rows_value","table_1_rows_1_label":"Cost structure","_table_1_rows_1_label":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_1_rows_label","table_1_rows_1_value":"Recurring monthly fee","_table_1_rows_1_value":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_1_rows_value","table_2_rows_1_label":"Cost structure","_table_2_rows_1_label":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_2_rows_label","table_2_rows_1_value":"One-time flat placement fee","_table_2_rows_1_value":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_2_rows_value","table_1_rows_2_label":"Who employs the VA","_table_1_rows_2_label":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_1_rows_label","table_1_rows_2_value":"Athena","_table_1_rows_2_value":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_1_rows_value","table_2_rows_2_label":"Who employs the VA","_table_2_rows_2_label":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_2_rows_label","table_2_rows_2_value":"You","_table_2_rows_2_value":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_2_rows_value","table_1_rows_3_label":"Time to placement","_table_1_rows_3_label":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_1_rows_label","table_1_rows_3_value":"2 – 3 weeks","_table_1_rows_3_value":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_1_rows_value","table_2_rows_3_label":"Time to placement","_table_2_rows_3_label":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_2_rows_label","table_2_rows_3_value":"2 - 3 days","_table_2_rows_3_value":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_2_rows_value","table_1_rows_4_label":"Replacement window","_table_1_rows_4_label":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_1_rows_label","table_1_rows_4_value":"Unknown","_table_1_rows_4_value":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_1_rows_value","table_2_rows_4_label":"Replacement window","_table_2_rows_4_label":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_2_rows_label","table_2_rows_4_value":"12 months","_table_2_rows_4_value":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_2_rows_value","table_1_rows_5_label":"Best for","_table_1_rows_5_label":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_1_rows_label","table_1_rows_5_value":"Founders who want a fully managed experience with built-in coaching, oversight, and who don't mind the higher cost or 12-month commitment","_table_1_rows_5_value":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_1_rows_value","table_2_rows_5_label":"Best for","_table_2_rows_5_label":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_2_rows_label","table_2_rows_5_value":"Founders and operators ready to manage a direct hire and prefer to keep recurring overhead off the books","_table_2_rows_5_value":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_2_rows_value"},"align":"full","mode":"preview","metadata":{"name":"full-picture"}} /--><!-- wp:acf/image-card-grid {"name":"acf/image-card-grid","data":{"headline":"Already using Athena but want to switch? Here’s how","_headline":"field_image_card_grid_block_headline","subheadline":"If you’ve decided to switch from Athena to a direct hire, the cleanest path takes about four weeks. Here’s the order of operations:","_subheadline":"field_image_card_grid_block_subheadline","columns":3,"_columns":"field_image_card_grid_block_columns","card_title_size":"large","_card_title_size":"field_image_card_grid_block_card_title_size","cards":3,"_cards":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards","cards_0_image":308,"_cards_0_image":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_image","cards_0_eyebrow":"01","_cards_0_eyebrow":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_eyebrow","cards_0_title":"","_cards_0_title":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_title","cards_0_text":"Document the work Athena’s VA is doing now. The next person needs SOPs, not just a job description.","_cards_0_text":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_text","cards_1_image":303,"_cards_1_image":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_image","cards_1_eyebrow":"02","_cards_1_eyebrow":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_eyebrow","cards_1_title":"","_cards_1_title":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_title","cards_1_text":"Book a consultation to tell us about the role, hours, required skills, ideal background. We’ll have a candidate slate to you in roughly 72 hours.","_cards_1_text":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_text","cards_2_image":304,"_cards_2_image":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_image","cards_2_eyebrow":"03","_cards_2_eyebrow":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_eyebrow","cards_2_title":"","_cards_2_title":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_title","cards_2_text":"Plan an overlap window. Keep Athena’s VA in place for two to four weeks while you screen, interview, and onboard the new hire.","_cards_2_text":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_text","cta_text":"Book a consultation","_cta_text":"field_image_card_grid_block_cta_text","cta_url":"#booking-footer","_cta_url":"field_image_card_grid_block_cta_url"},"align":"full","mode":"preview","metadata":{"name":"switch"}} /--><!-- wp:acf/accordion-faq {"name":"acf/accordion-faq","data":{"headline":"Frequently Asked Questions","_headline":"field_accordion_faq_block_headline","faqs":10,"_faqs":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs","faqs_0_question":"What countries do you hire from?","_faqs_0_question":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_question","faqs_0_answer":"\u003cp\u003eWe focus on four key regions:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eLatin America and The Caribbean\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eThe Philippines\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSouth Africa\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eEgypt\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eOur Latin American Virtual Assistants are especially popular with US businesses, thanks to their exceptional English fluency with minimal accents, strong cultural alignment with US business practices, and convenient time zone overlap with North America.\u003c/p\u003e","_faqs_0_answer":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_answer","faqs_1_question":"How do taxes \u0026 payroll work when hiring Virtual Assistants?","_faqs_1_question":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_question","faqs_1_answer":"\u003cp\u003eOur partner company takes care of all payroll and compliance requirements for your Virtual Assistant. This means you can focus on growing your business while they handle tax compliance, payroll processing, legal requirements, and international payment regulations.\u003c/p\u003e","_faqs_1_answer":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_answer","faqs_2_question":"How do you get paid?","_faqs_2_question":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_question","faqs_2_answer":"\u003cp\u003eIt’s simple – we charge a one-time flat fee, but only after you’ve found your perfect match. Whatever hourly pay you decide to pay goes directly to the Virtual Assistant you hire.\u003c/p\u003e","_faqs_2_answer":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_answer","faqs_3_question":"What's the difference between Staffing and Recruiting Agencies?","_faqs_3_question":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_question","faqs_3_answer":"\u003cp\u003eStaffing agencies charge monthly fees but only pay a small portion to Virtual Assistants. At Remote Leverage, we charge just one flat fee after you hire. Your Virtual Assistant receives 100% of what you pay them directly. This attracts higher-quality talent and eliminates ongoing middleman costs.\u003c/p\u003e","_faqs_3_answer":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_answer","faqs_4_question":"What if I have questions and need help after hiring?","_faqs_4_question":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_question","faqs_4_answer":"\u003cp\u003eAfter hiring your Virtual Assistant, you’ll have access to a dedicated Customer Success Manager who will help ensure your success with reviewing performance, monitoring progress, training guidance, and any other questions.\u003c/p\u003e","_faqs_4_answer":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_answer","faqs_5_question":"What if they don't turn out to be a good fit?","_faqs_5_question":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_question","faqs_5_answer":"\u003cp\u003eWhile it’s rare to have issues since candidates are thoroughly vetted by both our team and you, we offer a 12-month replacement guarantee at no extra cost and unlimited candidate interviews to ensure you find the best match.\u003c/p\u003e","_faqs_5_answer":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_answer","faqs_6_question":"How is their English and Communication skills?","_faqs_6_question":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_question","faqs_6_answer":"\u003cp\u003eWe maintain extremely high standards for English fluency. All candidates must submit an English voice recording, and we only select those with fluent English and minimal accents. Only the best communicators make it through our screening.\u003c/p\u003e","_faqs_6_answer":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_answer","faqs_7_question":"Can I start with Part-time?","_faqs_7_question":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_question","faqs_7_answer":"\u003cp\u003eYes, you can start with either part-time or full-time. The minimum is 20 hours per week, as our most qualified Virtual Assistants prefer stable positions with consistent hours.\u003c/p\u003e","_faqs_7_answer":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_answer","faqs_8_question":"What time zone will they be working in?","_faqs_8_question":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_question","faqs_8_answer":"\u003cp\u003eYour Virtual Assistant will work according to your schedule and time zone. They’re accustomed to US hours, and you get to set the working hours that best fit your needs.\u003c/p\u003e","_faqs_8_answer":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_answer","faqs_9_question":"How much does the average Virtual Assistant cost?","_faqs_9_question":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_question","faqs_9_answer":"\u003cp\u003eVirtual Assistant hourly rates depend on their skills and experience: Entry Level is $6-$10 per hour, and Highly Experienced is $11-$15 per hour. The hourly rate you agree to pay goes directly to your Virtual Assistant.\u003c/p\u003e","_faqs_9_answer":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_answer"},"align":"","mode":"preview","metadata":{"name":"faq"}} /--><!-- wp:acf/booking-footer {"name":"acf/booking-footer","data":{"headline":"Book a free\u003cbr\u003econsultation","_headline":"field_booking_footer_headline"},"align":"full","mode":"preview","metadata":{"name":"booking-footer"}} /-->
